{"id":"reference/Optimization-Mode","kind":"langref","title":"优化模式","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Optimization-Mode","file":"reference/Optimization-Mode.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Optimization-Mode","text":"优化模式"},{"depth":3,"slug":"debug","text":"debug"},{"depth":3,"slug":"fast","text":"fast"},{"depth":3,"slug":"safe","text":"safe"},{"depth":3,"slug":"small","text":"small"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Optimization-Mode\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#Optimization-Mode\">优化模式</a></h2>\n\n      <p>Zig 提供四种优化模式：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a>（默认）</li>\n        <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#fast\">fast</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#small\">small</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>向 <code class=\"file\">build.zig</code> 文件添加标准构建选项：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">build.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">build</span>(b: *std.Build) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> optimize = b.standardOptimizeOption(.{});\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> exe = b.addExecutable(.{\n        .name = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"example\"</span>,\n        .root_module = b.createModule(.{\n            .root_source_file = b.path(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"example.zig\"</span>),\n            .optimize = optimize,\n        }),\n    });\n    b.default_step.dependOn(&amp;exe.step);\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>这样会提供以下选项：</p>\n      <dl>\n        <dt><kbd>-Doptimize=debug</kbd></dt><dd>关闭优化，启用安全检查（默认）</dd>\n        <dt><kbd>-Doptimize=safe</kbd></dt><dd>启用优化和安全检查</dd>\n        <dt><kbd>-Doptimize=fast</kbd></dt><dd>启用优化，关闭安全检查</dd>\n        <dt><kbd>-Doptimize=small</kbd></dt><dd>启用体积优化，关闭安全检查</dd>\n      </dl>\n      <h3 id=\"debug\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe example.zig</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <ul>\n        <li>编译速度快</li>\n        <li>启用安全检查</li>\n        <li>运行性能较慢</li>\n        <li>二进制文件较大</li>\n        <li>不要求可复现构建</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"fast\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#fast\">fast</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe example.zig -Ofast</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <ul>\n        <li>运行性能快</li>\n        <li>关闭安全检查</li>\n        <li>编译速度慢</li>\n        <li>二进制文件较大</li>\n        <li>可复现构建</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"safe\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe example.zig -Osafe</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <ul>\n        <li>运行性能中等</li>\n        <li>启用安全检查</li>\n        <li>编译速度慢</li>\n        <li>二进制文件较大</li>\n        <li>可复现构建</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"small\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#small\">small</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe example.zig -Osmall</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      <ul>\n        <li>运行性能中等</li>\n        <li>关闭安全检查</li>\n        <li>编译速度慢</li>\n        <li>二进制文件较小</li>\n        <li>可复现构建</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Compile-Variables/#Compile-Variables\">编译变量</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Build-System/#Zig-Build-System\">Zig 构建系统</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":44,"translated":44}}
